      ],
      "source": "https://www.elespanol.com/usa/en/20250225/pueblo-fantasma-arizona-resucito-abandonado-convertirse-destino-turistico/926407510_0.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The ghost town has been revived into a tourist destination, drawing visitors who seek its eerie charm.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
